/imageFile22.png>)\nStarting from a sandwich (a) or brickwork (b) structure relative stable dimer conﬁgurations evolved. The ﬁgure shows representative snapshots.\n![](<b173789c57a86e786d6b0f05d35c1962ed13d99ddf633fa3749acc3af6aadbc1_images/imageFile38.png>)\n- Figure 3:\n![](<b173789c57a86e786d6b0f05d35c1962ed13d99ddf633fa3749acc3af6aadbc1_images/imageFile18.png>)",
